Stream games and your desktop from a PC running Sunshine or GameStream

Moonlight is a client for NVIDIA GameStream and Sunshine. It streams games, or your whole desktop, from a gaming PC to this computer.

- Hardware-accelerated video decoding
- H.264, HEVC and AV1 with HDR support
- 7.1 surround sound
- Gamepads with force feedback and motion controls for up to 16 players
- Pointer capture for games and direct mouse control for remote desktop
